	"data": "Journal — 2026-08-14 08:32\n\nOverview\nMorning journal, ~4 minutes. cithoreal wakes up with \"burning inspiration\" — a clear shift from the elaborate-understanding-replaces-action pattern he's been in. He's naming the need to become the leader he's been seeking, not just support someone else's leadership.\n\nMood & Energy\nEnergy: High — \"burning inspiration,\" morning clarity, sense of urgency\nEmotion: Determined, aspirational, slightly anxious about time slipping\nTone: Resolute — shorter than usual…",
